_summary_i18n":{"cn":"这一切都是都罗的计划，为的是让果切身体会到建造树屋的原因：为了躲避野兽的侵袭、在与野兽的争斗中抢来主动地位。果成功获得了爬高的勇气，但现在又面临着新的问题：他不敢从屋顶上爬下来了！","en":"Turns out, that was Toro's plan all along—to help Frui see why the treehouses exist: to keep beasts away and give them the advantage if they have to fight. Frui finally finds the courage to climb high, but now he's too scared to come back down!","jp":"これはすべてドゥロの計画で、ツリーハウスを建てる理由を身をもって理解させるために仕組まれたものだった。つまり野獣の襲撃を避け、争いの主導権を握るためである。ゴルはついに勇気を手にし、高所恐怖症を克服したかに見えたが……なんと屋根から降りるのが怖いというのだ！","kr":"사실 이건 모두 듀로의 계획이었다. 과르에게 직접 나무집을 세우라고 한 것은 짐승의 습격을 피하고 그 싸움에서 주도권을 쥐게 하기 위해서였다. 하지만 과르는 높은 곳에 오를 용기를 얻었지만 새로운 문제가 생겼다. 바로 지붕에서 내려올 용기가 없었던 것이다!"},"context_summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"context_summary_record_index":25528,"context_summary_record_indices":[25528],"context_summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","context_summary_source_asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10012310","context_summary_direction":"next_plot_summary","context_summary_distance":1,"episode_title_source_cn":"血月将至","episode_title_i18n":{"cn":"血月将至","en":"Thorns of Devotion","jp":"紅き月の刻","kr":"붉은 달의 예언"},"episode_title_status":{"cn":"exact_unique","en":"exact_unique","jp":"exact_unique","kr":"exact_unique"},"episode_title_evidence":{"source":"Config/Season.luae","table_key":"105","season_type":"105","entry_condition":"ed.ConditionX.IsUserInEp(\"Ep05\")","opening_quest":"15010101","episode":"ep5","status":"explicit_episode_and_opening_quest"},"asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10029610","asset_path":"ep5/npcpanel_menu/NodeCanvas__DialogueTree__ep5__npcpanel_menu_10029610.decoded.json","graph":"stories/ep5/npcpanel_menu/10029610.graph.json","locales":{"cn":"locales/cn/ep5/npcpanel_menu/10029610.json","en":"locales/en/ep5/npcpanel_menu/10029610.json","jp":"locales/jp/ep5/npcpanel_menu/10029610.json","kr":"locales/kr/ep5/npcpanel_menu/10029610.json"},"machine_locales":{},"stats":{"source_node_count":7,"graph_node_count":3,"effect_event_count":0,"text_entry_count":0,"speaker_entry_count":0,"cast_state_line_count":0,"path_dependent_cast_state_count":0,"cinematic_count":0,"picture_count":0,"subtitle_count":0,"cinematic_dialogue_count":0},"dialogue_statement_ids":[],"cinematic_statement_ids":[],"previous_plot_asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10013170","next_plot_asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10012310","previous_story_asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10013170","next_story_asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10012310"},"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10029370":{"episode":"ep5","category":"npcpanel_menu","story_id":"10029370","sequence_index":141,"plot_row_index":"6771","order_index":"6771","numeric_id":"10029370","physical_section":"ep5","plot_id":"10029370","dialogue_kind":"Menu","metadata_source":"story_metadata_generated_context","metadata_sources":["story_metadata_context"],"summary":"","context_summary_source_cn":"呼临城和雅库伯尔的下葬事宜一切顺利。祭祀仪式上摩根成功召唤出了死者的灵魂，让生者得以与他们正式道别。摩根打算继续研究能让人死而复生的魔法，他对死神似乎很不满。","context_summary_i18n":{"cn":"呼临城和雅库伯尔的下葬事宜一切顺利。祭祀仪式上摩根成功召唤出了死者的灵魂，让生者得以与他们正式道别。摩根打算继续研究能让人死而复生的魔法，他对死神似乎很不满。","en":"The burials are finished. At the ritual, Morgan summons the souls of the dead, allowing the living to say a proper goodbye. Now, he turns his focus back to studying magic that can revive the dead. He seems to deeply resent the God of Death.","jp":"ホーリンとヤクボルの葬儀はすべて順調に終わった。儀式では、モルガンが死者の魂を呼び出し、残された家族と別れをすることができた。死神に不満を持つモルガンは、このまま死者を蘇らせる魔法を研究するつもりらしい。","kr":"보칼리스와 아쿠보르의 장례가 순조롭게 진행되었다. 제사 의식에서 모르간은 죽은 자들의 영혼을 불러내 산 자들과 작별 인사를 할 수 있게 도왔다. 모르간은 죽음의 신에게 강한 불만을 감추지 않고 계속해서 죽은 자를 살리는 마법을 연구할 것이라고 했다."},"context_summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"context_summary_record_index":25581,"context_summary_record_indices":[25581],"context_summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","context_summary_source_asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10031230","context_summary_direction":"previous_plot_summary","context_summar